<%- include('partials/head', { title, description, bodyClass }) %>

<main class="auth-main">
  <div class="auth-glow auth-glow-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="auth-glow auth-glow-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="auth-shell">
    <section class="auth-aside">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/img/logo.svg" alt="" width="42" height="42">
        <span class="brand-name">Zeroix<strong>Api</strong></span>
      </a>
      <h1>Masuk. Ambil key. <span class="text-gradient">Mulai request.</span></h1>
      <p>Dashboard untuk mengelola API key, kuota, whitelist IP, tiket, dan riwayat pemakaian.</p>
      <ul class="auth-points">
        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2"></i> API key otomatis untuk akun baru</li>
        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2"></i> Kuota dan masa aktif transparan</li>
        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2"></i> Dokumentasi + tester di browser</li>
        <li><i data-lucide="check-circle-2"></i> Monitoring dan log request</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="auth-quote glass-card">
        <p>“Yang saya butuh cuma endpoint yang jelas dan kuota yang tidak bikin kaget.”</p>
        <span>— prinsip desain ZeroixApi</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="auth-card glass-card">
      <div class="auth-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">SELAMAT DATANG</span>
        <h2>Masuk ke akunmu</h2>
        <p>Belum punya akun? <a href="/register<%= ref ? '?ref=' + encodeURIComponent(ref) : '' %>">Daftar gratis</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <% if (loggedOut) { %><div class="inline-note inline-note-success"><i data-lucide="check"></i> Kamu sudah logout. Sampai jumpa lagi!</div><% } %>
      <% if (registered) { %><div class="inline-note inline-note-success"><i data-lucide="check"></i> Akun berhasil dibuat. Silakan masuk.</div><% } %>

      <form method="post" action="/login" class="form auth-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
        <input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= next %>">
        <label class="field">
          <span>Email</span>
          <div class="input-icon"><i data-lucide="mail"></i><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" required autofocus></div>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>Password</span>
          <div class="input-icon"><i data-lucide="lock"></i><input type="password" name="password" id="loginPassword" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Masukkan password" required><button type="button" class="password-eye" data-toggle-password="loginPassword" aria-label="Lihat password"><i data-lucide="eye"></i></button></div>
        </label>
        <div class="form-between">
          <label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="remember" checked> Ingat sesi ini</label>
          <a href="/forgot-password">Lupa password?</a>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block btn-lg" type="submit"><i data-lucide="log-in"></i> Masuk</button>
      </form>

      <div class="auth-divider"><span>atau lanjutkan dengan</span></div>
      <div class="oauth-row">
        <a class="btn btn-oauth <%= app.oauth.google.enabled ? '' : 'is-disabled' %>" href="/auth/google" title="<%= app.oauth.google.enabled ? 'Login dengan Google' : 'Belum dikonfigurasi' %>">
          <span class="oauth-g">G</span> Google
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-oauth <%= app.oauth.github.enabled ? '' : 'is-disabled' %>" href="/auth/github" title="<%= app.oauth.github.enabled ? 'Login dengan GitHub' : 'Belum dikonfigurasi' %>">
          <i data-lucide="github"></i> GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
      <% if (!app.oauth.google.enabled && !app.oauth.github.enabled) { %>
        <p class="auth-hint"><i data-lucide="info"></i> Login sosial belum dikonfigurasi. Isi GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/SECRET atau GITHUB_CLIENT_ID/SECRET di environment.</p>
      <% } %>

      <p class="auth-terms">Dengan masuk, kamu menyetujui <a href="/terms">Syarat & Ketentuan</a> dan <a href="/privacy">Kebijakan Privasi</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer', { scripts: [] }) %>
